        "en": "Cold wind moved through the tall green grass. The morning sun was bright and warm, but the air was still cold. The Silver River was very fast and loud. It came from the high blue mountains in the far north. On the wide plains, Valerius walked near the water. His silver armor was bright in the morning sun. He held his heavy iron shield in his left hand and touched his long sword with his right hand. He looked across the river into the dark forest.",
