        "en": "Astraea smiled softly and offered him a cup of fresh water. \"Do not worry, brave knight,\" she answered kindly. \"The light of the stars is strong. Nature always finds peace after a long winter. The trees protect the good people, and the river brings life to every small plant.\" Suddenly, a small twig snapped in the thick shadow of the ancient oak trees. The birds stopped their morning song. Everything went completely silent.",
