        "en": "Valerius did not draw his sword, but his hand stayed on the golden hilt. \"You walk on our kingdom border, Zephyr,\" the knight said sternly. \"The king wants order on the roads. Many farmers cannot travel because strange shadows lurk near the bridges.\" Zephyr crossed his arms and looked at the mountain peaks. \"Your king knows stone walls and gold coins, but he does not know the ancient language of the wind. A great storm is coming from the burning east. The animals can feel it. Even the great bears sleep with open eyes.\"",
