        "en": "Before Valerius could answer the young ranger, a bright red spark flew across the blue sky. It fell from the high black rocks above the canyon. The air became hot and dry in a second. Smoke rose from the dry grass near the bank. Ignis stepped onto a high flat stone. He wore a heavy red cloak that looked like liquid fire. In his right hand, he held a tall burning staff. Small flames danced across his fingers and staff. \"Everything burns for the great forge!\" Ignis yelled loudly with a fierce grin. \"Why do you talk about small borders when the fire below the earth wants to break free?\"",
