        "en": "Valerius raised his shield against the falling ash. Zephyr checked the wind with his fingers. Ignis lowered his burning staff and watched the dark clouds. Four heroes from four different lands stood together on the river bank. They had different weapons and different magic, but they all understood one simple truth: the peace of their world was broken, and a great dark journey was waiting ahead.",
