        "en": "Valerius stepped forward and placed his heavy iron gauntlet on the table. \"Brothers and sisters of the realm,\" the knight began in a commanding voice. \"The Ash Sun hangs above our world. The shadow beasts attack our villages, and the Void Rift is opening under the Iron Mountains. We cannot win this war alone. Knights, rangers, dwarves, and mages must fight together as one united vanguard.\"",
